#reference "crt/crt-guest-advanced-pal.slangp"
# Wolf64: Commodore 1702-inspired PAL Luma/Chroma profile.
# Independent settings; no CyberLab preset is incorporated.
# Tube/mask settings are a visual approximation, not a measured 1702 calibration.
# See UPSTREAM.md for provenance, signal choice and licensing.

